# Per-run scratch must never be committed. Cloned apps, generated specs, logs,
# runbooks, comparison reports, and the scorecard are local-only artifacts of a
# run — they live in the external $WS workspace, but ignore them here too in case
# anyone points $WS inside the repo tree.
apps/
*/generated-spec.json
*/generate.log
*/lint.json
*/lint.log
*/runbook.md
*/comparison*.md
SCORECARD.md
results.json
manifest.json
*/boot_outcome
